or","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-02-22T12:06:11Z","updated_at":"2026-02-23T20:49:52Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested in v4.6.1\n\n### System information\n\nLinux Mint 22\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a tileset has a custom data layer that's a string, and you edit that string on a tile that already has a value, if you press the Delete key (on your keyboard) to delete the character to the right of the cursor, it deletes the tile in the tileset (as well as deleting the character).\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Download and open the dummy project below\n2. Select the `TileMapLayer` node, then the `TileSet` tab at the bottom\n3. Click the `Select` button and choose the top-left tile (green platform)\n4. Expand `Custom Data` and click inside the `Type` field, putting the cursor at the beginning of the word `Platform`\n5. Press the `Delete` key on you keyboard to delete the letter `P`\n\nThe tile is deleted from the tileset.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nHere's a dummy project to help replicate the issue: [tileset-data.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25468367/tileset-data.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116618/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116618/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}